This project includes a Python implementation of the Filen client protocol,
written from Filen's public API documentation and cross-checked against the
official SDKs:

- filen-sdk-go (https://github.com/FilenCloudDienste/filen-sdk-go), MIT license,
  Copyright (c) FilenCloudDienste GmbH — reference implementation for the
  cryptographic formats and API behaviour.
- filen-sdk-ts (https://github.com/FilenCloudDienste/filen-sdk-ts),
  AGPL-3.0 license, Copyright (c) FilenCloudDienste GmbH — used as a reference
  only; no source code was copied from it.

The integration structure follows ha-internxt
(https://github.com/TheRealSimon42/ha-internxt), MIT license.

The Filen logo and wordmark in custom_components/filen/brand/ come from the
official Filen press kit (https://filen.io/hub/content/files/2025/06/Filen-Press-Kit.zip)
and are used only to identify the Filen service. All rights remain with Filen.

This is a community project, not an official Filen product.
